  "record": {
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "The earlier probe did not answer the requested gameplay question, and its hostile phase was invalid because the observer remained under an indefinite TASK_STAND_STILL. That null result is withdrawn. A replacement hostile-detection probe is now built and installed (SHA-256 D2BD5042D6BB2512442396B8C07BF1B0E8EF7E8C67875CB3D73B0677C360BEF5). It uses a fresh active hostile guard per trial and logs actual combat/flee/event transitions at 20 Hz across day/night sight distances, stance and locomotion, sound-only movement, 100-1000 ms visibility pulses, cover/LOS, lantern off/on, and clear/rain/fog. The audit remains incomplete and this issue remains actionable until the in-game matrix is run and analyzed. Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#119 does not have sufficient evidence for acceptance before those results.",
